###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#skillName
<http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#skillName> rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
                                                                   rdfs:domain <http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#Skill> ;
