                                                                   <http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#levelValue> 3 ;
                                                                   rdfs:comment """Description: The individual demonstrates consistent and reliable performance in standard situations. They can apply their knowledge and skills independently in familiar contexts.
