###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#Expert
<http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#Expert> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                         <http://purl.org/nemo/gufo#FunctionalComplex> ,
                                                                         <http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#ProficiencyLevel> ;
                                                                <http://purl.org/nemo/gufo#hasQualityValue> 5 ;
                                                                <http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#levelValue> 5 ;
                                                                rdfs:comment """Description: The individual demonstrates exceptional skill and knowledge. They can perform at a high level in a wide range of complex and unpredictable situations. They often serve as a reference point for others.
Characteristics: Innovates solutions, mentors others, and exhibits a comprehensive and sophisticated understanding of the field.
Example: A student who can lead a team project, design complex software systems, and provide innovative solutions to novel problems.""" ;
                                                                <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hiddenLabel> "NP5" .


