                                                                    <http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#levelValue> 4 ;
                                                                    rdfs:comment """Description: The individual shows a high level of competence and can handle complex tasks and problem-solving independently. They can apply their skills in various contexts and adapt to new situations.
